    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener><dateline><date when="1947-11-10">November 10, 1947</date></dateline>
                    <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Paul
                        Tillich</rs>:</salute>
                </opener>
                <p>Sorry to be very late in answering your letter of October 20.<note type="ea"
                        >Liegt nicht vor.</note> A rather similar inquiry sent by <rs
                        ref="#tillich_person_id__5066" type="person">Hedda Korsch</rs> has resulted
                    in a longish letter, of which I enclose a copy for your information.</p>
                <p>I am afraid that I can&apos;t be any more optimistic in thinking about <rs
                        ref="#tillich_person_id__1923" type="person">Mrs. Tillich</rs>&apos;s
                    chances than in regard to <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__5066" type="person">Hedda
                        Korsch</rs>. The latter has worked with the <choice>
                        <abbr>AFSC</abbr>
                        <expan>American Friends Service Committee</expan>
                    </choice> for years in the Nyack program,<!-- noch nicht ermittelt --> and is
                    already very well known to the staff – – and yet – – She also has invitations,
                    particularly for Grimme<!-- Adolf Grimme? -->.</p>
                <p>I shall make some unofficial inquires at the office when we will discuss
                    personnel later in the year, but as of now, I am afraid the chances of an
                    appointment would be extremely low. Sorry.</p>
                <closer>
                    <salute>Good luck for your work. Greetings.<lb/>Cordially,</salute>
                    <signed><hi rend="hand"><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__4553" type="person">Hertha
                                Kraus</rs></hi><lb/><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__4553" type="person"
                            >Hertha Kraus</rs></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
